    <string name="settings_privacy_message">Local-mode meal plans, diary entries and water records remain on this device. Account-mode profile and nutrition records may be stored through Firebase. AI analysis sends only the information needed for the selected service. Do not enter passwords, identity numbers or other sensitive information in meal notes.</string>
    <string name="help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="help_subtitle">A quick guide to recording meals, planning and understanding results.</string>
    <string name="help_quick_start">Quick start</string>
    <string name="help_quick_start_steps">1. Use Quick Add to record a meal or water.\n2. Open Meal Plan to arrange today’s meals.\n3. Review nutrition totals on Home and Reports.\n4. Use reminders to keep a regular meal rhythm.</string>
    <string name="help_faq">Frequently asked questions</string>
    <string name="help_q_recognition">What if food recognition is inaccurate?</string>
    <string name="help_a_recognition">Use a clear, well-lit photo with one main dish. Review the food name, portion and nutrition result before saving. AI estimates are references rather than medical measurements.</string>
    <string name="help_q_offline">What is local mode?</string>
    <string name="help_a_offline">Local mode works without signing in. Meal plans, diary entries and water records are stored only on this device and are not automatically restored after uninstalling the app.</string>
    <string name="help_q_report">Why is a report empty?</string>
    <string name="help_a_report">Reports require saved meal records in the selected period. Record meals first, then return to Reports. In account mode, also check the network connection.</string>
    <string name="help_q_reminder">Why did a reminder not appear?</string>
    <string name="help_a_reminder">Check that notification and exact-alarm permissions are allowed, and that battery optimization is not restricting MenuWise. Then set the reminder again.</string>
    <string name="help_q_data">Where is my data stored?</string>
    <string name="help_a_data">Local-mode data stays on this phone. Signed-in profile and nutrition data may sync through Firebase. AI requests follow the service configured in AI nutrition settings.</string>
    <string name="help_health_notice">MenuWise provides dietary reference information and does not replace medical diagnosis or professional nutrition advice.</string>
</resources>
